{"id":"metal-ore","name":{"en":"Metal Ore","ja":"剛鉄鉱"},"desc":{"en":"A very hard, very heavy chunk of metal. It's difficult to melt and process, a bane for all blacksmiths. But the Ingots made from it are well worth it.","ja":"極めて硬く重い金属の塊。溶かすのも、加工 するのも、持ち運ぶのすら大変な職人泣かせ の鉱石。だが、これから精製されるインゴッ トには、苦労に見合うだけの価値があるはず。"},"level":8,"locations":[{"id":"northern-ruins","name":{"en":"Northern Ruins","ja":"北方遺跡"}},{"id":"arland-new-world","name":{"en":"Arland New World","ja":"アーランド新天地"}},{"id":"runestone-nest","name":{"en":"Runestone Nest","ja":"魔石の巣"},"parent":"continental-coastline"}],"traits":{"id":"heavyweight","name":{"en":"Heavyweight","ja":"重量感ある"}},"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":27}